WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.349
Pig put the apples down.

2
00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:32.630
"We can eat them later," said Cow.

3
00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:42.472
Cow went out of the barn.

4
00:00:42.473 --> 00:00:47.005
So did Cat and Dog and Bat.

5
00:00:47.006 --> 00:00:54.298
Now the barn was very quiet.

6
00:00:54.299 --> 00:01:07.488
Pig could hear some crows.

7
00:01:07.489 --> 00:01:11.595
But he could not hear his friends.

8
00:01:11.596 --> 00:01:20.585
Pig went back to the apples.

9
00:01:20.586 --> 00:01:24.231
"Mmm," said Pig.

10
00:01:24.232 --> 00:01:27.583
"How I love apples.

11
00:01:27.584 --> 00:01:34.392
Crisp . . . juicy . . . apples."

12
00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:36.929
Pig sniffed the apples.

13
00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:40.783
He sniffed them again.

14
00:01:40.784 --> 00:01:54.412
"No, Pig!" said Pig.

15
00:01:54.413 --> 00:02:03.342
"Do not eat those apples!"

16
00:02:03.343 --> 00:02:09.866
Cat and Bat sat at the table.

17
00:02:09.867 --> 00:02:13.981
"Where is Pig?" said Cat.

18
00:02:13.982 --> 00:02:17.111
"I don't know," said Bat.

19
00:02:17.112 --> 00:02:20.355
"I hope he comes soon.

20
00:02:20.356 --> 00:02:23.953
It is time to eat the apples."

21
00:02:23.954 --> 00:02:29.571
"I will get them," said Cow.

22
00:02:29.572 --> 00:02:34.542
"Oh no!" she cried.

